  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishing an Electronic System for Construction Monit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the Project is to establish an electronic system for urban planning control which will detect construction and demolition activities through satellite imagery and orthophoto images taken by drones, automatically verifying their legality, and promptly notifying the relevant authorities of any unauthorised construction or demolition.The Project aims to increase public awareness and participation regarding the prevention of illegal construction, as well as to enhance public ov</narrative>
  </description>
